  "notes": [
    "Subcategory 0x41 is the 8-button version and 0x42 the 6-button version. In the 8-button layout groups 1 to 8 are buttons A to H; in the 6-button layout group 1 is the On and Off buttons and groups 3 to 6 are buttons A to D. Software can set either layout.",
    "When software detaches the load from the buttons, the load responds to group 9, which is linked with the SET button, and group 1 controls only the LEDs.",
    "Group 9 controls the load only while it's detached from group 1."
  ],
